Package: octoplus
Version: 1.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libpipewire-0.3-0, libssl3, espeak-ng, systemd, nftables
Maintainer: OctoPlus Team <octoplus@local>
Description: Local-first semantic operating system buddy
 OctoPlus is an on-device semantic operating system daemon suite
 featuring proactive contextual nudges, local speech-to-text and text-to-speech,
 local LLM inference, sandboxed safety kernel, and verifiable zero unapproved egress.
